<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">Mark</book>
  <para style="h">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mark</para>
  <para style="mt">Mark</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien Tapa Jesu Khris’ lungdamna thu a kipatna tam bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kamsang Isaiah Laibu sunga a kigiel bangin, “En in, na lampi a siel dingin na mai-ah ka kamtaipa ka sawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />gamlahah mi khat tam bangin kiko hi: ‘ Topa pei nading lampi siel unlen, ama’ lampi na tangsah un,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gamlahah baptize-pa John kihil a, mawna maisah nading kisiakiana tawh kisai baptize-na thu hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judea gam buppi le Jerusalem-a mi zosie ama kungah pei-in a mawnate uh a pulah vua, tuaci’n Jordan gun sungah a ki-baptize uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in John in kala-oh mul tawh a kigan puon sil a, a kawngah savun kawnggah gahin kauphe le khuoizu-in a kiva hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in, “Ka nua-a ang pei ding pa pen kei sangin vanglien zawtham a, kunin a kedap khaute sut ding nangawnin ka kilawm sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in tui tawh note kang baptize hi; hizongle ama in Hlagau Siengtho tawh note ang baptize ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Galilee gam Nazareth khuo panin Jesu pei-in John in Jordan gunah a baptize hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tui sung panin a thawto laitahin vantung kiphalsuo a mu a, ama tungah vakhu bangin Hlagau Siengtho a kumsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vantung panin aw khat ging a, “Nang pen kang it mama ka Tapa na hi hi; nang tungah ka lungkim mama hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuale thakhatthu-in Hlagau Siengtho in ama senel gamah a sawl pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Senel gam sungah ni sawmli sung om a, Satan in ama a ze-et hi; tuale gamsate tawh omton a, vantung mite in ama kem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />John a kimat zaw ciengin Galilee gamah Jesu pei-in Pasien lungdamna thutha tangko a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuale ama in, “A hun ang tung ta a, Pasien’ manggam ang nai ta hi; kisiakia unlen lungdamna thu tha um un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Galilee Tuipi dung zui-in Jesu a pei laitahin Simon le a naupa Andrew, tui sungah len a khu laitah uh a mu hi, azieh pen ama gel pen ngabengte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale Jesu in ama gel kungah, “Keima ei zui un, tua hile mi mante kang suohsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama gel in zong thakhatin a len uh nuasie-in ama a zui pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bakhat a pei zaw ciengin ama in gunkuong sunga len phaw-a a om Zebedee’ tapa James le a sanggampa John a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in thakhatin ama gel hlan a, ama gel in zong a pa uh Zebedee le a thacielte uh gunkuong tawh nuasie-in ama a zui pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Capernaum khuo ah amate a pei uhi; tuale sabbath ni a tun ciengin kikhopna inn sungah ama lutin thu a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in ama’ thuhilna lamdang a sa uhi, azieh pen ama in thukham hil siete bang hi loin thuneipa khat bangin thu hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua laitahin a kikhopna inn vuah hlabua in a mat mi khat om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nazareth mi Jesu aw, nang le ko bang kisai i hei? Ko ei susie dinga ang pei na hi amah? Pasien’ Mi Siengtho na hi lam ka thei hi,” ci-in a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in ama ngelawt a, “Ham sin, tampa sung panin pusuoh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua hlabua in mipa kongkawsah a, a aw nei za tawh awngin ama sung panin a pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate in a unpi-un lamdang a sa vua, “Tam thu bang hi poma ahei? Thuneina tawh a kigen thuhilna tha khat ahi hi! Ama in thu pie po leh hlabuate nangawn in mang na lai uhi,” ci-in khatlekhat a kidong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thakhatthu-in Galilee gam kimvel zosie ah a minthanna a kizel pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate in kikhopna inn a nuasie behun Simon le Andrew-te inn ah James le John tawh a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Simon’ sungnu cithuo-in lupmun tung ngahin om a, tuale ama kungah tua nu thu thakhatin a gen pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama pei-in a khut tawh tua nu kai-in a phongto hi. Tua ciengin a cithuo natna dam a, zindo a kipan pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khumi nitah, nitum zaw ciengin amate in cina zosie le dawivei zosie ama kungah a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuale a khuozangpi-un kotkhah gei-ah a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in natna tuomtuom a vei cina tampite damsah a, dawi tampitah a notmang hi; dawite in a thei ziehin ama in a ham ding uh a phal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zingmawng khuova masangin gamdaina munah ama pei-in tuanah thu a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Simon le a guolte in ama a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama a mu ciengun amate in, “Mi zosie in ang sui uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama in, “Tam khuoveng tengah pei vai, tuate lahah zong thu ka gen ding hi; azieh pen tami sem dinga ang pei ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Galilee gam muncin tengah ama zinin a kikhopna uh innte sungah thu genin dawite a notmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Miphah khat ama kungah pei-in khupdin a, “Nei damsah nop po leh nei damsah thei hi,” ci-in a thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesu in hepihuoisa-in a khut zahin tham a, ama kungah, “Kang damsah nuom hi. Dam pai in!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Thakhatin a phahnatna in ama nuasie-in a dam pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Khautahin ama thu a hilkhol zaw ciengin thakhatin peisah pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />ama kungah, “Tami thu koima kungah gen malmal sin; ahi vangin pei-in siempu pa kungah va kilah ta’nlen amate tungah teci ahi dingin Moses thupieh bangin na damna ziehin biehna pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hizongle ama pei-in a genthang kawikawi hi. Tua ahi ziehin khuopi sungah Jesu a langtangin lut thei ta loin khuo pulam gamlahah a om hi; hizongle ama kungah mun zosie panin mite pei veve hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni bang za ahei zaw ciengin Capernaum khuo ah ama kilekia a, inn ah ama om hi, ci thu kiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n kotkhah mai nangawnah mun om nawn lo za dongin mi tampi a kikhawm uhi; tuale ama in zong amate kungah thu a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin mi pawlkhat pei-in mihing li in phalsi khat zawngin ama kungah a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi a tam sengin Jesu kung a tut zo lo ziehun amate in Jesu’ opna sontah innkhum a phelkhe uhi; tuale amate in a vang khat a vu zaw ciengun a lupna pheh tawh phalsi mipa a khiesuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu in amau’ upna a mu ciengin phalsi mipa kungah, “Ka tapa aw, na mawna teng ang kimaisah zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum sunga a to thukham siete pawlkhat in a lungsim sung vuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Bang dinga tam mipa hici ham mawh ahei? Pasien gensie ahi hi! Pasien khat beh longal koi in mawna maisah thei ahei?” ci-in a ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu in amau’ ngaisutnate thakhatin thei pai ahi ziehin amate kungah, “Bang zieha na lungsim vua tam thute na ngaisut uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Phalsi mipa kungah, ‘Na mawnate kimaisah zo hi,’ ci ding le, ‘Tho-in na lupna pheh puo inlen pei in,’ ci ding koi baizaw ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin Mihing Tapa in leitungah mawnate maisah thei nading thu a nei lam note in na thei nadingun ama in phalsi mipa kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Na kungah kang gen hi, tho-in na lupna pheh la inlen na inn ah pei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama tho-in thakhatin a pheh la a, amate zosie mai-ah a peikhie pai hi; tuaci’n amate zosie in lamdang a sa vua, Pasien phatin, “Tam bang dan poma i mu ngai nai vawt sih hi!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khatvei tuipi gei-ah Jesu peikia hi; ama kimvelah mihonpi a kikhawm vua, tuale amate thu hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama a pei kawikawi laitahin siehdonna zumah a to Alphaeus’ tapa Levi mu a, ama kungah, “Ei zui in,” a ci a, ama tho-in a zui pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levi’ inn ah Jesu le a nuazuite nitah an ne-in a to laitahin siehdongte le mawneite tampitah zong ama tawh a toton uhi, azieh pen ama a zui mi tam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thukham hil Pharisee-te in mawneite le siehdongte a toton a mu uh ciengin amate in a nuazuite kungah, “Bang dinga siehdongte le mawneite tawh an a neh ton uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu in tami thu a zah ciengin amate kungah, “Cidamte in sievuon tulmaw loin cinate beh in tulmaw hi; midihte hlan dinga ang pei ka hi sih a, mawneite hlan dinga ang pei ka hizaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />John’ nuazuite le Pharisee-te in an a tang uhi; tuale mite pei-in ama kungah, “John’ nuazuite le Pharisee-te in an tang napi bang dinga na nuazuite in an tang lo uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Zineipa tawh a opton laitahun mopawi simte in an bangci tan thei ding uh ahei? Zineipa tawh a opton laisie-un amate in an a tang thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate kung panin zineipa a kilahdawh hun ang tung ding a, khum ni ciengin amate in an a tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Koima in puonbeh tha tawh puonlui phaw ngai lo hi; a phaw zenzen leh a kiphawna puonbeh in puonlui kai-ehin a ehbe zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Koima in savun um lui sungah lenggatui tha thal ngai lo hi; a thal khah mawh leh lenggazu in savun um phukehin lenggazu kibuo ding a, savun um zong kisie ding hi; savun um tha sungah lenggazu tha kithalzaw a, tuaci’n a ni-in kikembih thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sabbath ni khatin bulei nawhin ama pei a, tuale a peikawmun a nuazuite in buvui a zut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pharisee-te in ama kungah, “En in, bang dinga amate in Sabbath ni-a bawl dinga kilawm lo nate bawl uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “David in a pawlte tawh gilkielin neh ding a kisap laitahin bang bawl ahei ci thu na sim ngai sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Siempu lien pa Abiathar hun lai-in Pasien inn sungah ama lut a, siempute beh in a neh thei Ompina anlum ne-in a pawlte zong kimkhat a pie hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a kung vuah, “Mihingte adinga Sabbath ni kibawl ahi a, sabbath ni dinga mihingte kibawl ahi sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Mihing Tapa pen sabbath ni nangawn a uhpa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kikhopna inn sungah ama lutkia a, khum sungah a khut langkhat si mi khat na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in ama a mawmat thei nadingun sabbath ni-in tua pa ang damsah poma ei mah, ci-in a buhdap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale ama in a khut langkhat sipa kungah, “A mailamah hing pei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in amate kungah, “Sabbath ni-in a pha bawl ding le a sie bawl ding, mihing hinna hutdam ding le mi tha ding koi pen thukham tawh a kituoh ei?” a ci hi. Ahi vangin amate a sip dide uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in lungthah mai tawh amate a en kawikawi hi; a lungtang uh a khauh ziehin ama da mama a, tua mipa kungah, “Na khut zah vawi,” a ci hi. Ama in a khut a zah leh a khut a dam pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pharisee-te pei-in ama a tha thei nadingun Herod pawlte tawh thakhatin a kikum pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nuazuite tawh tuipi lamah Jesu a kihem dawh a, Galilee gam panin mihon tampite in ama a zui uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ama’ nasepna zosie a zah ciengun Judea, Jerusalem, Idumea, Jordan galkhat, le Tyre le Sidon kima gamte panin mihon tampitah in ama kungah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipite a tam seng ziehin a nawh gawp khah lo nadingin gunkuong khat a baisa-a a koi nadingun ama in a nuazuite kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in cina tampi damsah zo ahi ziehin natna nei zosie in ama a thamkhah thei nadingun ama lam a neh vapual uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hlagau buate in ama a mu popo ciengun a mai-ah khupbawhin, “Nang Pasien Tapa na hi hi!” ci-in a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama koi ahei, ci mi a theisah lo nadingun khautahin amate thu a vaihlah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Muoltungah ama kato a, ama in a dei teng a kungah hlanin, tuale amate in zong ama a zuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuale ama in a sawltahpite ci-in a minvaw, mi sawm le nite teel a, amate pen a kithuopi ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />le dawite hawlkhiet nading thuneina nei ding ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a teel mi sawm le nite: Simon (Peter ci-in a minvaw pa);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zebedee’ tapa James le a naupa John (Vanging Tapate a cinopna Boanerges ci-in a minvawte);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Andrew, Philip, Bartholomew, Matthew, Thomas, Alphaeus’ tapa James, Thaddaeus, Canaan mi Simon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />le ama a lehehpa Judas Iscariot-te ahi uhi. Tua ciengin ama inn ah a pei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuale mihonpite a kikhawmkia vua, tuaci’n amate in an nangawn a ne thei ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mite in, “Ama a maw ahi ta hi,” ci thu a innkuonpite in a zah ciengun ama a kham dingin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem pana a peisuh thukham hil siete in, “Ama pen Beelzebul in a mat ahi a, dawite’ mangpa suonga dawite a deldawh hi bo,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuale ama kungah amate hlan a, ama in thugentena zangin thuhil a, “Bangci bangin Satan in Satan deldawh thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gam khat ama le ama kikhenthangin kido leh tua gam a kip zo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Innkuon khat ama le ama kikhenthangin kido leh tua innkuon zong a kip zo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Satan ama le ama kido-in kikhenthang leh kip zo lo ding a, a manthai hun a tung zo ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanle mi thahatpa lep-ia masa lopi-in koima in mi thahtapa’ inn sungah lutin a neisa teng a lahpieh thei sih ding hi; tua cieng behin a inn sung a bulu thei pan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“A tahtah a kang ci-in, mite’ mawna le Pasien a gensietna popo uh kimaisah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ahi vangin Hlagau Siengtho a gensie poma a mawna uh kimaisah zo lo ding a, kumtawnin maw nei ahi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in, “Ama hlabua nei ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nu le a naute a tung uhi; amate inn pulamah dingin ama hlan ding mi a sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama kimvelah mihonpi a to uhi; tuale amate in ama kungah, “Nang ang hlan dingin na nu, na sanggam pasalte le na sanggam numeite a pulamah ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in, “Ka nu le ka sanggamte i ci koite ahiei?” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuale ama kimvela a tote enin ama in, “Ka nu le ka sanggamte tanah a om uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka pa’ deina banga a gamta mi poma ka sanggam pasal, ka sanggam numei le ka nu ahi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuipi gei-ah thuhil dingin ama a kipankia hi. Ama’ kimkotah mihon tampi tahte kikhawm uh ahi ziehin gunkuong tungah ama kato-in tuanah to a, tua laitahin tuipi gei-ah mihonpite a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah thugentena tampi tawh tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai un! Khaici vawpa khat khaici vaw dingin a kuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuale ama in khaici a vaw ciengin kimkhat lam lai-ah kie a, vate lengin a netum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khaici adangte ahile lei tam lona, suong tamna munah kie a, lei sa seng lo ahi ziehin thakhatthu-in po pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale ni ang suoh a, nisa in a kaa gawp hi; zung thuh hla lo ahi ziehin a vulnang pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Adang khaicite lingkawm lahah kie a, tuale lingkungte hing khangin dep gawp ahi ziehin ga a ga zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khaici dangte lei hoina munah kie-in a kungte po-in khanglien a, a za zakhat, a za sawmguh, a za sawmthumin a ga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, “Zah nading bil nei poma in za taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama tanga a op laitahin ama kimvela a omte le nuazui sawm le nite in tua a thugentenate a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Na tung vuah Pasien’ manggam thusimte theitheina ang kipieh vangin a pulama omte tungah na zosie thugentena tawh kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen, ‘Amate in enen napi a mu thei lo nading, ngaingai napi a tel thei lo nading, amate kihei-in a mawna uh a kimaisah lo nading,’ ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale ama in amate kungah, “Tami thugentena na thei sih uh amah? Tua ahile thugentena zosie bang na ci thei ta ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khaici vawpa in thu a vaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lamdunga kivawte tam bang mite ahi hi: Amate in a zah uh ciengin thakhathu-tin Satan pei-in amate sunga kivawsa tua thu a lahpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale suong tamna lei lahah a kivawte tam bang mite ahi hi: Amate in thu a zah behun lungdam tahin a sang pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate zung hla loin bakhat sung beh hing zo a, tua thu ziehin lungkhamna le bawlsietna a thuoh uh ciengin a puakia pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Adang ling lahah a kivawte pen tam bang mite ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitung lunghimawnate le hau nopnate in tua thute depgawp ahi ziehin bangma ga a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lei hoina munah a kivawte tam bang mite ahi hi: Amate in thu a zah ciengun pom pai-in a za zakhat, a za sawmguh, a za sawmthum a ga mite ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Meivah a tunna-ah tung loin, lawkhu ding po ahi sihle lupna nei lah po a koi dinga ang kitawi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Azieh pen pholah dingte simlo phuoldap ding bangma a om sih a, theisah dingte simlo bangma thusim zong a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zah nading bil nei poma in za ta uheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Na thu zahte uh limtahin ngaisun un; na pieh za ma uh na ngakia ding vua, a tamzaw ang kipiehbe lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a neite kipiehbe ding hi; bangma a nei lote tung panin a neisun nangawn uh kilahpieh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in, “Pasien’ manggam pen mi khat in lei lahah a the khaici tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sun le zanin kimu zel tho zel a, tua a khaici po-in na khang a, ama in bangci khan ci thu a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Leitang in ama thu-in ga a gasah a, a masa penin a kung, tua zaw ciengin a vui, tua zaw ciengin a vui sungah a tah a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahi vangin bu a min ciengin anlah hun tung ta ahi ziehin ama in thakhatin a phieukawi tawh pei-in a at hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in, “Pasien’ manggam pen bang tawh tekahin, bang thugentena zangin gen ding i hi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua pen ankam tang tawh kibang hi, lei lahah a kivaw laitahin leitunga om khaici lah panin a neupen ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />hizongle a kivaw ciengin ang khanglien a, ankung zosie lahah a golpen ang suoh hi, tuale a ba golpite ang zam a, vate in a hlim nei-ah bu a bawl uhi,” ci-in a gen leuleu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in tam bang thugentena tampi tah zangin amate thuhil a, a ngai zaw za cieng uh thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in thugentena lo tawh amate tungah thu gen lo a, hinanle a nuazuite kungah a tuomin thu zosie a hilcien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khumni nitah lam ciengin ama in amate kungah, “Tuipi kantanin galkhat lamah pei vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuale amate in mihonpite nuasie-in ama’ na tuonnasa gunkuong tungah tuongtonin a peipi uhi. Ama tawh gunkuong dangte zong a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huipi le guo kithuo nasie tahin lang a, tuihuol in gunkuong sat gawpin gunkuong sungah tui dimlet ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama ahile gunkuong nua lamah tangkham khamin a kimu hi; tuale amate in ama phongin, “Siepa aw, ka manthai ding uh khawh ei sa lo na mah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama zong tho-in huipi kungah, “Lang nawn sin! ci-in hosie a, tuipi kungah, “Dai dide in!” a ci hi. Tua ciengin huilang khawlin a dai dide pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Bang dinga zau na hi uh ahei? Upna na nei nai sih uh amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate in lamdang sa-in khatlekhat a kiho vua, “Huipi le tuipite nangawn in a thu a mang valongin, tua ahile tampa koi ahi diei?” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amate, tuipi galkhat Gerasenes gam sungah a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gun-kuong tung panin a kumsuh zaw behin hlabua veipa khat in ama na dawntuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama pen hankhuh lah po-a teng ahi a, koima in siakhau nangawn tawh hen zo lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />azieh pen kengkol le siakhau tawh tamveipi kihen ngai zo a, ahi vangin ama in a kihenna siakhau bottanin a kengkol suguoi gawp a, koima in ama zo zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sun le zanin hankhuhte lah le muoltung tengah vahin awng vapuoh den a, suongte po tawh ama le ama a kikuikeh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a gamla panin Jesu a gal mu ciengin del phei-in a mai-ah a kun hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuale ama in a aw nei za tawh, “Sangpen Pasien’ Tapa Jesu aw, kei bang ei law sawm na hei? Pasien’ min tawh kang thum hi, kei ei bawlsie sin,” ci-in awng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam banga a cina pen ama in tuapa kungah, “Nang hlabua aw, ama kung panin hing pusuoh in!” a na ci zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in ama kungah, “ Na min bang ahei? ci-in dong hi. Ama in, “Ka min Legion ahi hi; azieh pen a tampi ka hi uhi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua gam panin amate a nawdawh lo nadingin ama kungah a thum vangut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua laitahin muolpangah vohhon tampi gamta-in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuale hlabua pa in ama kungah, “Vohte kungah ei sawl inlen a sungah ei lutsah in,” ci-in a thum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in amate a peisah hi. Tuale hlabuate pusuohin vohhon sungah a lut uhi; tul ni bang a pha tua voh honte, luibang kenah taisuh vapualin tuipi sungah a tummang sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vohcingte tai-in khuo sung le gam sung tengah tam thu a gen uhi. Tua ciengin tua thupiengte bang thu ahei ci-in a en dingin mite a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu kung a tung uleh a lungsim pilin puon sila a na to hiuhiau dawi legion khat a vei mipa a mu ciengun a zau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dawiveipa le vohhonte tunga thupieng teng a musa mite in midangte kungah a gensawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin a gam panun a pei dawh nadingin amate in Jesu kungah thum a kipan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gunkuong tungah ama a kato laitahin dawivei ngai mipa in ama tawh a opton nading a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in nielin tua pa kungah, “Inn ah pei inlen Topa in nang tungah bangzatahin hing sem a, bang khuotuona teng hing lah ahei, ci thu na guolte kungah va gen ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale ama pei-in Decapolis gam sungah Jesu in ama dinga a sepnate gen a kipan a, mi zosie in lamdang a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gunkuong tungah tuongin Jesu galkhat lam a kaikia zaw, tuipi gei-ah a op laitahin a kimvelah mihon tampite a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin a min Jairus a kici kikhopna inn uhte khat va pei a, tua pa in ama a mu ciengin a keng phungah bawhin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ama kungah, “Ka tanu neuno a si ding ahi ta hi. Ama ang damkia-in a hin thei nadingin hing pei inlen a tungah na khut hing nga ta’n,” ci-in tamveipi tah a thum vangut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n tua pa tawh ama a zawhton hi. Tuale mihon tampi in ama a zui vua, ama a nehcip gawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua laitahin kum sawm le kum ni sung siluong natna a vei numei khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sievuon tampi in a na lawmawsa ahi ziehin gimna nahpi-in na thuoh a, a sum neisun a thawigawt vangin nuomtuom loin a gim semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua nu in Jesu’ thu na za a, mipite kawmkal ama nualamah peidap vakhianin a puontep a va tham ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tua nu in, “A puontep thamkha beh leng zong dam pai ta vang,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuale thakhatin a siluong khawl pai a, a natna a dam ahi lam a kithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesu in ama sung panin a vanglietna a peikhiet lam thakhatin phawh ahi ziehin mihonpite lamah kihei-in, “Ka puontep ei thampieh khu koi ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A nuazuite in ama kungah, “Mihonpi in ang nehcip gawp lam na thei nahpi bang dinga, ‘Koi ahiei ka puontep ei thamkha,’ na ci thei mawng ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in tua banga ei thamkha koi poma ahei, ci-in a en kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahi vangin numei nu in ama tunga a pieng thute thei ahi ziehin zau le ling kawmin ama mai-ah khupbawhin thupieng zosie mantahin a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in tua nu kungah, “Ka tanu aw, na upna in nang ang damsah zo hi; na natna pan dam inlen lungnuomtahin na pei ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama in a hopi laitahin makai pa’ inn panin mi pawlkhat pei-in, “Na tanu si zo ta. Bang dinga siepa na buoisah nah lai ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amau’ kiho Jesu in a galzah ciengin kikhopna inn uhpa kungah, “Zau sin, um zieu lel in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in Peter, James, le James’ sanggampa John simlo koima kinuazui sah lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kikhopna inn uhpa’ inn ah a lut ciengun, ama in mite kapin mau-in a ul valuoi a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama a lut ciengin amate kungah, “Bang dingin gamlumin kap na hi uh ahei? Naupang pa a si ahi sih hi, a kimu ahi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuale amate a nuiza mama uhi. Tua ciengin a unpi-in amate pusuohsah a, naupang’ nu le pa le a optonpi mite tawh naupang opna munah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama in tua nu a khutah tu-in ama kungah, “Talitha cum,” a ci hi. A khietna pen, “Numeino aw, tho in!” a cinopna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua numeino zong thakhatin tho a, lam pei a kipan pai hi. (ama pen kum sawm le kum ni cing ahi ta hi). Amate in tami thu lamdang a sa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tami thu koima a theisah lo nadingun ama in khautahin thupie a, tua nu a neh ding bang khat pie un, ci-in amate kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama in khum mun nuasie-in a pienna khuopi lam zuonin pei a, a nuazuite in ama a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sabbath ni-in kikhopna inn sungah thuhil kipan a, ama thuhil a za mi tampite in lamdang a sa uhi. Amate in, “Tam pa in tami thu zosie hei pana a lah a diei? Ama tunga kipie khu bang pilna ahi ta diei? A khut tawh na lamdangte a bangci bawl thei a diei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama pen khutsiempa Mary’ tapa hi lel lo amah? A sanggamte zong James, Joses, Judas le Simon-te hi lo uh amah? A nau numeite zong tanah eite tawh om hi lo uh amah?” a ci uhi. Tuale ama tungah a lungkim sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah, “Kamsangte pen a khuo a tui, a tanaute lah le a inn sung vuah ci simlo zatahna nga loin a om sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua hi a, ama in khum sungah cina tawmno khatte tungah a khut nga-in a damsah ci longal na lamdang a bawl thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amau’ up lona pen ama in lamdang a sa hi. Tua ciengin ama in khuotate lahah thuhilin a zin kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in sawm le nite hlan a, amahaw nita-in sawlin hlabua neite tungah thuneina a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in a khuolzinna vuah ciengkhut khat ci simlo, bangma an, thungip, kawnggah sunga sum cite a vom lo nadingun thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin kedap bul unlen, songkhol ni silthuo sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Inn sung khatpo-ah na lut uh ciengin khum mun pan na peidawh masangun tua inn ma-ah om suoh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mun khatpopo ah hing kisang loin, na thugen uh a kingai nuom sih leh, na pei ciengun amate langkhatah teci dingin na keng vua leivui bangte thingkhie un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate a peikhie vua, mi zosie a kisiakia nadingun thu a hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in dawi tampi a hawlkhie vua, cina mi tampi sathau nu-in a damsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu’ min kithei sieng ta ahi ziehin Herod kumpipa in tua thu a za hi. Mi pawlkhat in, “Sina panin Baptize-pa John ang thokia ta hi; tami thu ziehin ama in tam bang vanglietnate a bawl thei ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hizongle adangte in, “Ama Elijah ahi hi,” a ci uhi. Adangte in, “Tanglai kamsangte ma banga kamsang khat ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin Herod in tua thu a zah ciengin, “A ngawng ka tansanpieh pa John ang thokia ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen Herod in a naupa Philip’ zi Herodias a kinunpi hangin Herod mama in mi sawlin John mansahin, tuale ama lep-ia a, thong sungah a khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile John in Herod kungah, “Na sanggampa’ zi na kinunpi pen ngaina om lo hi,” ci-in a na gengen zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale Herodias in ama huo-in that nuom hi. Ahi vangin ama nu in a that zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Azieh pen John, midih le mi siengtho ahi hi, ci thu Herod in thei ahi ziehin ama zatahin a panpi hi. A thugen a zah ciengin ama lungbuoi mama hi; hinanle a thugen a ngai nuom veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama’ suopawi ni-in Herod in a uliente, a galkapmangte le Galilee gam sunga a om makaipite adingin anvana khat a nei ciengin khum ni-in ama ading hun lemtang khat a tung kha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A tanu Herodias sungtumin a lam ciengin tua nu in Herod le a zinte a lungkimsah mama hi; tuale kumpipa in ngahnu nu kungah, “Na dei popo ngen in, kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua nu tungah ama nasie tahin kiciem a, “Na nget popo, ka gam phalkhat nangawn kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua nu pusuohin a nu kungah, “Bang ka ngen diei?” a ci hi. A nu in, “Baptize-pa’ John lutang ngen in,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua nu zong thakhatin kumpipa kungah tai pai a, “Kuong khat sungah Baptize-pa John’ lutang ei pie pai lacin nuom vang,” ci-in a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kumpipa da mama hi; hizongle a kiciemnasate zieh le a zinte maitang a zatahna ziehin tua nu a khia nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa in John’ lutang ang peipi nadingun a cing galkap khat thupie-in a sawlpai hi. Ama pei-in thong sungah ama’ ngawngtan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />kuong khatah tawi-in tua nu kungah a pie hi. Tua ciengin ngahnu nu in a nu a piesawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama’ nuazuite in tua thu a zah uh ciengin pei-in a luonghawm la-in hankhuh khat sungah a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesu kimvelah sawltahpite kikhawmin ama kungah a sepna zosie ule a thuhilna zosie uh a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Gamdaina mun khatah pei unlen bakhat sung khawl phot tadi un,” a ci hi. Azieh pen a tung a kuon mi tampi kiphamatin a om vua, amate in anneh nading hun-awng nangawn a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Gunkuong tungah tuongin gamdaina mun khatah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mi tampi in a pei lam uh mu-in amate ahi lam zong a thei ziehun khuopi zosie panin leilam zui-in khum munah a na tai vua, a amate sangin a na tung masazaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lui pieu a gei laitahin ama in mihon tampi mu hi; ama in a cing om lo tuute tawh kibang sa ahi ziehin amate tungah lainatna a nei hi; tuale ama in amate thu tampi hil ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khuomiel kuon ciengin ama kungah a nuazuite pei-in, “Tami mun pen gamdaina mun ahi a, khuo zong miel kuon ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />I kimvela khuota tengah amate va pei-in a an neh ding uh a lei thei nadingun amate sawl in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in a kung vuah, “A neh ding uh bangkhat popo pie un,” ci-in a dawng hi. Amate in ama kungah, “Sum denarii zani man tawh anlum lei-in a neh dingun ka va pie ta ding uh amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuale ama in a kung vuah, “Anlum bangza na nei vuoi? Pei-in va en ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in lohing tungah mi zosie a pawlpawlin a to nadingun thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pawlpawlin zakhat, sawmnga ta ci bangin amate a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama in anlum nga le nga tawn ni la-in vantung lam ento a, tuale lungdam a ko zaw ciengin tua anlumte balkehin mipite mai-a lui dingin a nuazuite a pie hi; tuale amate zosie lahah ama in tua nga tawn ni a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuale a unpi-un ne-in a gil uh a va mama hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />tuale amate in khomun le nga themneng teng a khawm vua, seu sawm le ni a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Anlum a ne pasal tul nga a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ama in mihonpite a peisah laitahin thakhatin a nuazuite zong gunkuong tungah tuongsah a, galkhatah a om Bethsaida khuo ah a mapeisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Amate mangpha a pai zaw ciengin, thungen dingin ama muol tungah kato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Nitah lam ang hi ciengin tuipi laikimah gunkuong om a, ama pen leitungah ama tangin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hui a lelan ziehin hamsapi-in gunkuong a haw lam uh ama in a mu ciengin, zingmawng lamin amate lam zuonin tuipi tungah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in tuipi tunga a pei ama a mu ciengun sihla sa-in a kiko uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />azieh pen a unpi-un ama a mu ciengun a zau mama uhi. Ahi vangin ama in thakhatin amate hopi a, “Kilungnuomsah un, keima ka hi bo hi; zau sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate tawh gunkuong tungah ama kato a, huipi zong a dai pai hi. Tuale amate in lamdang a sa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in anlum tungtang thute a thei lo ziehun a lungkhau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Amate a galkai zaw ciengun Gennesaret gam tungin gunkuong khi-in a khawlsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Gunkuong tung panin a kumsuh ciengun mite in ama a na theipai vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />tua gam buppi sungah mite a tai kawikawi vua, ama om hi, ci-a a zahna mun popo vuah a lupna pheh utawh cinate a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Amate in khuopite, khuotate, lozaute le vanzuana munte-a kipan ama’ peina mun zosie-ah cinate a na koi vua, ama’ puontuol mongtep nangawn a thamsah nadingin ama kungah a thum uhi; tuale a thamkha zosie in damna nga uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kimkotah Pharisee-te le Jerusalem pan a pei thukham hil siete a kikhawm vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a nuazuite pawlkhat in khut sil lo a cinopna ahi, khutbua pi tawh an a neh lam uh amate in a mu kha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />(Azieh pen Pharisee-te le Jew mite zosie in upate’ tang ngaina a zui ziehun khut silsieng kilkel loin an a ne sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />vanzuana panin a pei ciengun zong kisil masa loin an a ne sih uhi; tuale amate in haite, umlebelte, sumngo kuongdaite sawpsiengna-a kipan tang ngaina dang tampi tah zong a tang lai uhi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pharisee-te le thukham hil siete in ama kungah, “Na nuazuite in upate’ tang ngaina zui loin bang dingin khutbua pi tawh an ne uh ahei?” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “No mihoi kipangte thu Isaiah in a mantaha a na gensa tam banga a kigielna-ah, ‘Tam mite in a kam pi-un kei ei zatah vua, hinanle a lungsim uh kei tawh kigamla hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />amate in mihingte’ bawltawm ngainate, zui ding ngaina bangin a hil vua, a mawhna-in kei ei bie uhi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note in Pasien’ thupiehte taisanin mihingte’ tang ngainate na tukip uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a kung vuah, “Na tang ngainate na zui thei nadingun Pasien’ thupiehte pampai dan na siem ta mama uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen Moses in, “Na nu na pa na zatah un,’ ci hi; tuale, ‘A pa ahi sihle a nu a gensie poma si valon ding hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hizongle mi khatpo in a nu ahi sihle a pa kungah, ‘Keima tung pana na nga thei ding hunate pen Corban (Pasien tunga kipiesa a cina) ahi ta hi,’ a ci nah po leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a nu le a pate adingin bangma khat beh na semsah nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua bangin na luosuh uh na tang ngainate ziehun Pasien’ thu bangma lo na suo ta uhi. Tam bang danin note in na tampi na sem uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in mihonpite hlankia a, amate kungah, “Na unpi-un ngai unlen thei ta un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pulam panin a sungah tumin mi a buasah thei bangma om lo hi, ahi vangin ang pusuoh nate in mi buasah theizaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zah nading bil neite in za taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in mihonpite a nuasie zaw ciengin inn sungah tum a, a nuazuite in tua thugentena thu a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Tua ahile no zong a thei lo na hi bo uh amah? A pulam panin mihing sunga a tumsuh poma in mi buasah thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen lungtang sungah tum loin gilpi sunga a tumzawh ziehin khum panin a kithahkia thei lam thei lo na hi uh amah?” a ci hi. (Tua bangin ama in an zosie siengtho hi, ci-in a gen hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in, “A sung pana pusuohte in mihing buasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Azieh pen mihing lungsim tawng panin tam bang a sie ngaisutnate ang pei ahi hi: Numei-pasal pahtatna, guhtatna, tuolthana,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />angkawmna, huoihamna, gitlona, solna, thangtatna, thangsietna, mi daisahna, kihisahna, mottatnate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tam gitlonate zosie a sung lam pana pusuoh hi a, tuate in mihing a buasah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khum panin ama dingkhie-in Tyre gam lamah a pei hi. Inn sungah ama lut a, tua sunga a op lam koima a theisah nuom sih hi. Hizongle mi thei lo dingin ama a kiphuol thei sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ahi vangin a tanu hlabua nei numei khat in thakhatin ama thu za a, tuale ama pei-in a keng zungah a khupbawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua nu pen Gentile-te hi a, Syria gam Phoenicia khuo pieng ahi hi. Tua nu in ama kungah a tanu sung panin dawite a hawlkhiet pieh nadingin a thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in tua nu kungah, “Naupangte an nesah masa vai, azieh pen naupangte neh ding lahpiehin uite pieh ding kilawm lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua nu in, “Sie aw, sabuoi nei-a om uite nangawn in naupangte’ khateneng teng a ne uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in tua nu kungah, “Tua bang na ci ziehin na pei thei ta hi, na tanu sung panin dawi pusuoh zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n tua nu inn ah pei-in, lupna tunga a lum a tanu mu a, tua dawi a na peikhie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin Tyre gam panin kilekia a, Decapolis gam sunga om Galilee Tuipi lam zuonin Sidon lampi zui-in a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate in a bilbing a ham-awh mi khat ama kungah a peipi uhi; tuale ama pa tungah a khut a ngah nadingin a thum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in mihonpi opna panin tua mipa a tuomin peipi a, a bil sungah a khutme guongin a cil nu-in a lei a thampieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in van lam ento a, khuisa-in tua pa kungah, “Ephphatha,” a ci hi. Tua pen, “Kihong in,” a cina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuale a bil thakhatin kihong pai a, a lei zong kihlamin nuomtahin a ham thei pailien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in koima kungah a gen lo nadingin amate thu a pieh vangin, thu pie semsem le thanuom tahin a gen semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Gen thei lo za dongin amate in lamdang a sa vua, “Ama in na zosie a hoi-in bawl zo hi; bilbingte nangawn in khuo zasah a, a ham thei lote zong hamsah thei hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin neh ding nei lo mihon tampi a kikhopkia ciengun ama in a nuazuite hlanin a kung vuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Keima kungah mipite ni thum sung tahpi ang om zo ta vua, neh ding bangma zamtawng nei lo uh ahi ziehin hepihuoi ka sa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A gilkielin inn ah peisah mawh leng pawlkhatte a gamlapi pana ang pei uh ahi ziehin lamkalah lamba ta va uh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama’ nuazuite in, “Tami gamlahah mi tam zapi koi in bangci va zo ding ahei?” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Anlum bangza mawngmawng na nei vuoi?” ci-in dong hi. Amate in, “Sagi” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in mipite tuolah tosah a, anlum sagite la-in lungdam a ko zaw ciengin phalsuo a, a hawm dingun a nuazuite a pie hi; tuale amate in mipite tungah tuate a hawmpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in nganeu themkhat zong a nei uhi; thupha a pieh zaw ciengin tua teng zong a hawmsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in ne-in a gil uh va mama hi; tuale a khamval teng uh a khawm vua, seu sagi a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua sungah mi tul li bang pha uhi. Tuale ama in amate a peisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A nuazuite tawh thakhatin gunkuong tungah tuong a, Dalmanutha gamah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pharisee-te pei-in ama tawh thu kiniel a kipan vua, vantung panin lim khat a ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A lumgsim tawngah nahpi-in khuisa-in, “Bang dinga tam khang mite in lim a nget uh ahei? A tahtah a kang ci-in, tam khang mite tungah bangma lim a kipie poma sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale amate nuasie-in gunkuong tungah katokia a, galkhat lamah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nuazuite in anlum puoh ding a mangngil vua, gunkuong sungah anlum pum khat beh a nei tabo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale ama in a kung vuah, “Pilvangun, Pharisee-te le Herod’ tol kidawm un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in, “An i nei lo zieh hi ngel va,” ci-in khatlekhat a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu in tua thu thei ahi ziehin amate kungah, “Bang dinga na an nei lo uh gen talawm na hi uh ahei? Na lungtang vuah lut loin theicien nai lo na hi uh amah? Na lungtang uh a khau seng amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mit nei napi a mu lo na hi uh amah? Bil nei napi a za lo na hi uh amah? Note in na phawhkha ta sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi tulnga ading anlum nga ka phalsuo lai-in khamval seu dim bangza na luoh vuoi?” a ci hi. Amate in ama kungah, “Sawm le ni,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tuale mi tul lite ading sagi ka phalsuo lai-in a khamval uh seu bangza na luoh vuoi?” a ci hi. Amate in ama kungah, “Sagi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a kung vuah, “Na telthei nai sih uh amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bethsaida ah a amate a pei uhi. Mi pawlkhat in ama kungah mittaw khat a peipi vua, ama a tham nadingin a thumpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in tua mittaw pa a khut tawh tu-in khuo pulamah a peipi hi; ama in tua pa’ mitah a cil a nu zo ciengin ama tungah a khut ngam a, “Na khat popo na mu thei ei mah?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua mipa khuodah a, “Mite ka mu thei hi, hinanle amate pen singkung lampei tawh a kibang uhi” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in a mit tungah a khut ngam leuleu hi; tuale ama in teltahin a et ciengin khuo mukia a, na zosie cientahin a mu thei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin a inn ah ama peisah a, “Khuo sung nangawnah lut nawn sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesu le a nuazuite, Caesarea Philippi gam sung khuotate ah a zin dingin a pei uhi; tuale lam a pei laitahun a nuazuite kungah, “Mite in kei koi hi ei ci vuoi?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in, “Baptize-pa John; adangte in, Elijah; adangte leuleu in, kamsangte lahah khat,” ang ci uhi, ci-in a dawngkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Tua ahile note in kei koi hi nei ci vuoi? ci-in a dong hi. Peter in ama kungah, “Nang Messiah na hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuale ama’ tungtang thu koima tunga a gen lo nadingun khautahin thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Mihing Tapa in nahpitahin bawlsietna thuoh ding a, upate, siempu liente, le thukham hil siete in ama nielin kithat ding a, nithum zaw ciengin thokia ding hi, ci-in amate thuhil a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in kicien tahin tam thu a gen hi. Tuale Peter in ama tuom peipi-in phawsiet a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahi vangin a nuazuite a etkawmin ama kihei-in Peter phawhsie a, “Satan aw, ka nua lamah kihem in! Azieh pen nang in Pasien’ thu ngaisun loin mihing’ thu na ngaisunzaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in a nuazuite le mihonpite hlanin amate kungah, “Mi khatpo ka nuazui a suo nop leh, ama le ama kinielin a singlamte puo-in ei zui taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Azieh pen a hinna uh a hunkhie nuomte in a hinna uh tan ding a, keima zieh le lungdamna thu ziehin a hinna a taante in a hinna uh a hunkhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate in leitung buppi a nga vangun a hinna uh suplaw uleh bang phatuom ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A tahtahin, amate in a hinna uh bang tawh hleh theikia ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tami angkawm le mawna tawh a kidim khang mite lahah keima le ka thute ei maizumpi mite ahi ule, a Pa’ minthanna vang le a siengtho vantung mite tawh a minthangin Mihing Tapa ang peikia ciengin amate a zumpi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuale ama in amate kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, tam sunga a ding mi kimkhat in vanglietna tawh Pasien’ manggam ang tun a mu masangun sina a ciemkha sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni guh zaw ciengin Jesu in Peter, James, John-te a tuomin muolsang tung khatah a zawpi hi. Tuale amate mai-ah a mel kikhelin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a puonsilte tee lihlehin kang silsel a, leitungah puonsawp mi koima in a ngosah zawh lo ding za dongin a vam lihleh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum sungah Moses le Elijah kilaa a, Jesu tawh a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Peter in Jesu kungah, “Siepa aw, tam sunga i op ding uh a hoi hi; nang ading buh khat, Moses ading buh khat, le Elijah ading buh khat, buh thum ei lamsah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate a nahzau seng ziehun ama in ci nading mel a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin meiingo khat in amate tuomin meii lah panin, “Tam pa pen ka it mama ka Tapa ahi hi; ama’ thu na ngai un!” ci-in aw khat a ging hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thakhatin a kimkot a et uleh Jesu khat losie koima dang a mu nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Muol tung pan a kumsuh laitahun sina panin Mihing Tapa a thawkia masangsie, a sil mute uh koima kungah a gen lo nadingun ama in thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n tami thu amate teng beh thei-in a koi vua, sina pana thawkiana a ci pen bang a cinopna ahei, ci-in khatlekhat a kidong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in ama kungah, “Bang dinga thukham hil siete in Elijah ang pei masa ding hi, a ci uh ahei?” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Na zosie a bawlpha dingin Elijah ang pei masa tahpi ding hi. Tua ahile Mihing Tapa in zong gimna tampi a thuohdan ding le a kisimmawbawl dan ding teng a na kigielsa hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin ke’n kang ci-in, Elijah ang pei zo a, ama’ thu a kigielsa bangin ama tungah a dei bangun a bawl zo ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nuazuite kungah a tun ciengun a kimkot vuah mihon tampite a mu vua, thukham hil siete pawlkhat tawh a na kisel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihon buppi in ama a mu uh ciengin lamdang a sa vua, a hopi dingin a mailamah a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Amate tawh bang thu kisel na hi uh ahei?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihon lah panin mi khat in ama dawng a, “Siepa aw, nangma kungah ka tapa kang peipi hi; ama dawi vei-in ham thei lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tua dawi in ama a mat vanglah ciengin tuol satna-in nei a, a cilphuon buo-in a ha gawi-in a hui zong a kin zel hi; tuale na nuazuite kungah ei delmang pieh un, ci-in ka nget vangin a delmang zo sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “No upna nei lo khang mite aw, note lahah bang tanvei hing om nalai ding ka hei? Note bang tanvei hing thuoh zo lai ding ka hei? Ka kungah ama hing peipi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale amate in ama kungah tua naupang a peipi uhi. Tua hlagau in Jesu a mu ciengin thakhatthu-in tua naupang kinlawmsah a, ama tuolah pua-in kikhuleh a, a kam panin a cilphuon a buo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu in a pa kungah, “A hici zaw bang tanvei a sawt tai?” ci-in a dong hi. Ama in, “A neu lai-a kipan hi ta bo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua hlagau in tha sawmin meikhuh sung le tui sungah tamveipi sawnpua zo ta hi; ahi zongin na bawl thei ding khatpo a op leh ei hepi inlen ei panpi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Na bawl thei leh na ci amah! A um mi adingin na zosie kibawl thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thakhatthu-in naupang’ pa in, “Ka um ta hi; ka uplana ei panpi in!” ci-in a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu in a hontai valuoi mihonpite a mu ciengin tua hlabua kungah, “Tami naupangno a ham thei nading le khuo a zah thei nading a khahtan nang hlabua aw, ama kung panin pusuoh in, ci-in thu kang pie hi!” ci-in a hosie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua hlagau pengzahin naupangno nahpi-in a kinlawmsah zaw ciengin pusuoh a, tuale naupang misi tawh kibang ahi ziehin mi a tamzawte in, “Ama si ta,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in a khut tawh ama tu-in a phongto leh a ding thei pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Inn sungah ama a tum zaw ciengin a nuazuite in, “Kote in bang dinga ka delmang zawh lo uh ahei?” ci-in a dapdawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Tam bangte pawl pen antanna le thungetna beh tawh a kinotmang thei pan ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khumtah panin amate dingkhie-in Galilee gam a nawh uhi. Ama in koima’ thei ding a nuom sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />azieh pen ama in a nuazuite thuhil a, amate kungah, “Mihingte’ khut sungah Mihing Tapa kilehehin amate in that ding a, a kitha zaw a ni thum ciengin thokia ding hi,” ci thu a hil zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A nuazuite in a thugen a tel sih vua, hinanle a dong ngam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate Capernaum khuo-ah a tung vua, inn sungah a op laitahun ama in a kung vuah, “Lampi-a na kiselna uh bang thu ahei? ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate a sip khinkhian uhi. Azieh pen lampi-ah a lienpen koi ahei, ci-in khatlekhat a kisel zieh uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama to-in sawm le nite hlan a, amate kungah, “A masapen a suoh nuom poma in a nukhia pen le adang teng’ sila a suo phot kul hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin naupang khat kai-in amate lahah koi a, a kangah tawi-in amate kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Keima zieha tam bang naupang khat a limbawl poma kei ei limbawl ahi a, kei ei limbawl poma in kei ei limbawl hi loin kei ei sawl pa limbawl ahi zaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />John in ama kungah, “Siepa aw, na min tawh dawite a hawlkhie mi khat ka mu vua, ama in eite ei zui lo ziehin ka kham uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in, “Ama kham sih un; azieh pen ka min tawh na lienpi a sem mi koima in ei nua gensiet thei pah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ei langdo lo poma i pawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Azieh pen a tahtah a kang ci-in, Khris’ min na puoh ziehun dawn ding tui hai khat ang pie popo thaman nga loin a om poma sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Note khatpo in keima ei um tami naupangnote khat a puasah leh, a ngawng ah an gawina suong golpi khat khai-in tuipi sungah tummang dawh leh ama adingin hoizaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na khut in ang puasah leh tansan in; khut kim keng kimin mei a mi thei lona hell sungah na pei sangin khut sam keng samin hinna sunga na lut ding pen nang adingin hoizaw tham lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Na keng in ang puasah leh tansan in; keng kimin hell sunga ang kipai sangin keng langbai-a hinna sunga na lut ding nang adingin hoizaw tham lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Na mit in ang puasah leh khei dawh in; mittang kimin hell khuh sunga ang kipai sangin, mit langkhat beh tawh Pasien’ manggam sunga na lut ding nang adingin hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua sungah a than nangawn uh si ngai lo a, a mei uzong a mit ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Azieh pen mi zosie cisaw bangin mei tawh a kisaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ci hoi hi; ahi vangin ci a alna mang leh bang na ci alsahkia thei ding ahei? Note zong ci bangin al unlen, khatlekhat na kilem un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama in khum mun nuasie-in Judea gam le Jordan gungal tengah a pei hi. Tuale ama kimvelah mihonpi a kikhawmkia uhi; tuale, a bawl ngaisa ma bangin amate tungah thuhil a kipankia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pharisee-te pawlkhat pei-in a ze-etna-un ama kungah, “Pasal khat in a zi a khul ding a kilawm ma amah?” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in, “Moses in bang thu ang pie vuoi?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in, Moses in ahile pasal in kikhenna lai pie-a khul thei dingin ei phal hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanle Jesu in amate kungah, “Na lungtang khau seng zieh vua ama in tua bang thukham a giel ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin lei kisiemcil a kipanin, ‘Pasien in numei le pasal a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Tami thu ziehin pasal in a nu a pa nuasie-in a zi tawh kigawm ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tua ni tegel sa khat a suoh ding uhi,’ na kici hi.Tuaci’n ama gel ni hi nawn loin sa khat ahi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Pasien’ gawmsate koima in khen sih taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nuazuite in inn sungah tami thu ama a dongkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “A zi khul a, numei dang khat tawh a kinung poma a zi angkawmsan ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuale numei in a pasal khulin pasal dang khat tawh a kinun leh zong angkawm ma ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in naupangnote a tham thei nadingin mipite in ama kungah a peipi uhi; tuale nuazuite in khautahin amate a na hosie gawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in tua thu a thei ciengin lungthah a, amate kungah, “Naupangte ka kungah hing peisah un; kham sih un; bangzieh ahei cile Pasien’ manggam pen tua bang mite ading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ke’n a tahtah a kang ci-in, naupangno khat banga Pasien’ manggam a sang lo poma, tua sungah a lut ngai sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a kangah amate tawi a, a tung vuah a khut ngamin thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A khuolzinna zom dingin a pei laitahin ama kungah mi khat tai a, a mai-ah khupdinin, “Sie Hoipa aw, kumtawn hinna ka luo thei nadingin bang sem ding ka hei?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Bang dinga kei mihoi nei ci ahei? Pasien khat beh simlo koima a hoi om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang in: ‘Na that sih ding hi; ang na kawm sih ding hi; na gu sih ding hi; zuou teci na pang sih ding hi; mi neisa na lahpieh sih ding hi; na nu na pa na zatah ding hi,’ ci thupiehte na thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in, “Siepa aw, tam teng zosie ka neu lai-a kipan ka na zui siengsa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu in a et ciengin ama it a, “Na khat kisam lai teh; pei-in na neisa teng zua inlen tua sum teng mizawngte pie in, tua hile vantungah gou na nei ding hi; tua ciengin hing pei inlen ka nua ei zui in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in neilelam tampi a nei ziehin tua thu a zah bepin maipua-in a dasa-in a peikia ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in a kim a pam en kawikawi a, a nuazuite kungah, “Mihaute dingin Pasien’ manggam lut nading bang zatahin a hamsa diei izaw!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tami kammal ziehin a nuazuite in lamdang a sa mama uhi. Ahi vangin Jesu in amate kungah genkia a, “Tate aw, Pasien’ manggam lut nading bangza tahin hamsa ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihau khat, Pasien’ manggam sunga a lut ding sangin kala-oh khat hieumei hawm sunga a lut ding baizaw lai hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in lamdang a sa mama vua, “Tua ahile koi in hutdam a tang zo mawh ta diei?”ci-in khatlekhat a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesu in amate enin, “Tam pen mihingte adingin hi zo lo ma hi, ahi vangin Pasien adingin a himaw thu hi lo hi; azieh pen Pasien adingin na vannuoi hi thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Peter zong kipanin ama kungah, “En in, ko zong na zosie nuasie-in na nua kang zui uh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu in, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, keima zieh le lungdamna thu ziehin a innte, a sanggam pasalte, a sanggam numeite, a nu a pa, a tate, le a lote a nuasie poma in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tu khang hunin a za zakhat innte, sanggam pasalte, sanggam numeite, nute, tate, lote nga ding a, ang tung ding hunah kumtawn hinna nga lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin a masate tampi ang nukhia ding a, a nukhiate ang masa ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jerusalem zuonin a pei laitahun a masang vuah Jesu na ma pei hi; amate in lamdang a sa vua, a nua a zui mite zong a zau uhi. Ama in sawm le nite a tuomin peipikia-in ama tunga pieng ding thute gen a kipan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“En un, Jerusalem dongah i pei ding a, siempu liente le thukham hil siete’ khut sungah Mihing Tapa ki-ap ding a, tuale amate in sina thuoh dingin ama a mawmat ding uhi; tua ciengin amate in Gentile-te khut sungah a ap ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />amate in ama simmaw bawlin, cilphitin a that ding uhi; tuale ni thum zaw ciengin ama a thokia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama mai-ah Zebedee’ tapa James le John pei-in a kungah, “Siepa aw, kang nget popo uh nei bawlpieh dingin kang thum uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in ama gel kungah, “Bang hing bawlpieh leng na dei gel ei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama gel in, “Na minthanna kumpi topha tungah na to ciengin khat na zietlamah, khat na veilamah ei tosah in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in ama gel kungah, “Na sil nget uh pen na thei siem sih gel hi. Ka dawn ding hai ahi sihle ka ki-bapize nading sungah na ki-baptze zo ding gel ei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama gel in, “Hi zo na gel vang,” a ci uhi. Tua ciengin Jesu in ama gel kungah, “No tegel in keima’ hai na dawn ding vua, keima ei ki-baptizena ma tawh na ki-baptize ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka zietlam le ka veilam a to ding pen kei pieh thei ahi sih a, a bawlpiehsa mite ading hizaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Sawmte in tami thu a zah bepun James le John-te tungah a lungthah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jesu in amate hlan a, “ Gentile-te lahah gam-uh dinga kiciemte mite in amate tungah kiliensahin, a uliente un zong thuneina tawh amate a uh lam na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ahi vangin note lahah tua bang hi lo ding hi; note lahah milien a suoh nuom poma na nasem uh hizaw ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />note lahah a masa pen ahi nuom poma mi zosie’ sila ahi zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mihing Tapa zong midangte ama’ na semsah dinga ang pei hi loin, midangte’ na a sem ding le mi tampi tatkhiet nading ama’ hinna a pie dinga ang pei ahi zaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jericho ah amate a tung uhi. Ama in a nuazuite le mihonpite tawh Jericho a nuasie laitahin lampi gei-ah Timaeus’ tapa, Bartimaeus a kici mittaw khutdaw ngen khat na to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Nazareth khuomi Jesu ahi lam ama in a zah ciengin nahpi tahin kiko a, “David’ Tapa Jesu aw, ei hepi bo ven!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A sip khinkhian nadingun mi tampi in a kham vangun nahpi tahin ama awng semsem a, “David’ Tapa aw, ei hepi bo ven!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jesu khawlin, “Ama tanah hing hlan ta un,” a ci hi. Tuale amate in zong mittaw pa a hlan vua, ama kungah, “Kilungnuomsah in; ding in, ama in nang ang hlan hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in zong a puon tungsil paimangin tawndienin Jesu kungah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in ama kungah, “Bang kang bawlpieh ding na dei ei?” a ci hi. Mittaw pa in ama kungah, “Ka siepa aw, khuo ei musahkia in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Pei in; na upna in ang damsah zo hi,” a ci hi. Thakhatin ama in khuo mu theikia-in lampi-ah Jesu nua a zui pai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem tawh a kinai Oliv Muol gei-a om Bethphage le Bethany khuo a tun ciengun ama in a nuazuite ni sawlin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama gel kungah, “Na mai-vua khuo ah pei unlen, na lut lien uleh koima’ tuon ngai nai lona laano khat khau kikhisa-a om na mu ding uhi; a khau sut unlen hing kai ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi khatpo in, ‘Bang dinga tam banga na bawl uh ahei?’ ang ci leh, “ Topa in tulmaw hi, tamtah ma-ah hing koisahkia pai na va,’ ci un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama gel zong peipai-in, tuale lampi pulam kotkhah gei khatah laano a kikhi khat a mu uhi. Tua laano a khau a sut laitahun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a gei-a om mite in, “Bang dinga laano a khau na sut uh ahei,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama gel in zong Jesu’ kam vaihlah teng a gen uhi; tuale amate in kai ding a phal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu kungah laano a tut vua, a tungah a puonte uh pha-in Jesu a tuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi tampite in lampi-ah a puonte uh a na pha vua, adang pawlkhatte in gamlaha a sat uh singna bawhphate a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin a mai-a pei mite le a nuazui mihonpite in, “Hosanna! Topa’ mina ang pei pa in thupha nga taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ang tung ding i pu David’ kumpi gam in thupha nga taheh! Van a sangpen munah Hosanna!” ci-in a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jerusalem khuo ah ama lutin biehinnpi sungah tum a, na zosie a et kawikawi zaw ciengin, ni kai ta ahi ziehin sawm le nite tawh Bethany ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A zing ni, Bethany pan amate a peikia ciengun ama a gil a kiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Theikung a na pha khat a galmu a, a ga khat beh ka mu khah leh ci-in a en dingin a va pei ta hi. A zang a tun ciengin a nate simlo bangma khat beh a mu sih hi. Azieh pen thei ga hun hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in theikung kungah, “Koima in na ga nekia ngai nawn sih heh,” a ci hi. Ama’ nuazuite in tua thu a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jerusalem ah amate a tung uhi. Tuale biehinnpi sungah Jesu lut a, biehinnpi sunga om vanzuate le vanlei mite delmang dingin a kisa a, ama in sumkhelte’ tona sabuoite le paalva zuate’ tonate zong a khulepieh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuale ama in biehinnpi sungah van khatpo peipi ding koima a phal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in thuhil a, ‘Ka inn in mi namcinte’ thungetna inn kici ding hi,’ ci-in kigiel hi lo amah? Ahi vangin note in misuomte’ kibuhna kuo na suo ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siempu liente le thukham hil siete in tami thu a zah ciengun ama tha thei nading lampi a sui den uhi; azieh pen mihonpite in ama’ thuhilna lamdang sa mama uh ahi ziehin ama a giing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nitah ciengin khuopi pulamah Jesu le a nuazuite a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zingmawngin amate a pei laita hun tua theikung a hui dongin a gawta a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Peter in phawhkia a, ama kungah, “Siepa aw, en vawi tah! Na samsiet theikung gawta ta,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Pasien um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, tami muol kungah, ‘Kihemkhie inlen tuipi lilai sena’n kinei in,’ ci-in lung hei nei loin, na ci bangun tangtung ding hi, ci-in na up nah po uleh note adingin ang kibawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n note kungah kang ci-in, na nget popo uh ka nga zo hi, ci-a na up uleh na nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thungen dinga na din sielun mi khatpo tungah lungkimlona khatpo na nei khah uleh maisah un; tua hile vantunga om na Pa un zong na gamtat khielnate uh ang maisah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem ah amate a tungkia leuleu uhi. Biehinnpi sungah a pei laitahin ama kungah siempu liente, thukham hil siete, le upate pei-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Bang thuneina tawh tamte na bawl ahei? Tam teng bawl nadingin koi in thuneina ang pie ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Thu khat kang dong ding hi; ei dawng un, tuale ke’n zong bang thuneina tawh tam teng ka bawl ahei ci, kang gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />John’ kibaptize-na pen vantung pana ang pei ahi amah, ahi sihle mihing tung pana ang pei ahei? Ei dawng un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate khatlekhat kikumin, ‘Vantung pan hi,’ ci leih, ‘Tua ahile bang dinga ama na up lo uh ahei,’ ei ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi vangin, ‘Mihing tung pan hi,’ i ci ding uh amah,” a ci uleh mi zosie in John pen kamsang tahtah khatin ngaisun uh ahi ziehin mihonpite a giing vanuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in, “Ka thei sih uhi,” ci-in Jesu a dawng uhi. Jesu in amate kungah, “Ke’n zong bang thuneina tawh tamte ka bawl ahei, ci kang gen sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kungah thugentena zangin thugen a kipan hi. “Mi khat in lengga lo bawl a, a kimvelah dai kai-in, a sungah lengga cil nading dum to a, tausang khat daw hi; tua ciengin losapte kawmsahin gam dangah a zin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An lah hun a tun ciengin amate kung panin lengga lo pana a pieng ama’ nga ding teng khon dingin losapte kungah a sila khat a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in na manin na sat gawpin na guoh peisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate kungah sila dang khat sawlkia leuleu hi; tua pa zong a lu na satin na zako uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin adang khat sawlkia a, amate in tua pa zong na that uhi. Adang tampite zong tua bang ma-in a sawl uhi; amate in pawlkhat na satin adangte na that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a it mama tapa khat nei lai hi. A tawpna ah, ‘Ka tapa na zatah buong sam va uh,’ ci-in amate kungah a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin losapte in, ‘Tampa gamhluo ding pa ahi hi; hing pei un, ama that vai-in a gamh luo ding teng la vai,’ ci-in khatlekhat a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama manin a that vua, lengga lo pulamah a paimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahile lengga lo nei pa in bang a law diei? Ama pei-in losapte susie ding a, a lengga lo midangte a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tami Lai Siengtho sungah: ‘Innlamte in a nilmang suong pen innkiu suongpi a suoh zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tami khu Topa’ bawl ahi a, i mit mu-in lamdang hi,’ ci-a kigiel khu na sim ngai sih uh amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami thugentena pen amate a langgenna ahi lam a thei ciengun ama a man nuom vua, ahi vangin amate in mihonpite a giing uhi. Tuaci’n ama nuasie-in a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in thugenna tawh ama mawmat dingin a kungah Pharisee-te pawlkhat le Herod mi pawlkhat a sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuale amate pei-in, “Siepa aw, nang na citah a, koima zatah na nei sih hi; azieh pen nang in mi mai-et tuom na nei sih hi; ahi vangin thuman thutah tawh kituohin Pasien’ lampi na hil lam zong ka thei uhi. Kumpipa tungah sieh pieh huoi amah, pieh huoi lo ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pie ding ka hi uh amah, pie lo ding ka hi uh ahei?” a ci uhi. Ahi vangin amau’ kineitawmna a thei ziehin ama in a kung vuah, “Note in bang dinga kei nei ze-et uh ahei? Sum denarii khat hing la unlen ei velsah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale amate in dangka tang khat peipi uhi. Tua ciengin amate kungah, “Tami koi’ lim le koi’ min ahiei,” a ci hi. Amate in kumpipa’ lim le min ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Kumpipa’ nate kumpipa tungah pie unlen, Pasien’ nate Pasien tungah pie un,” a ci hi. Tuale amate in lamdang a sa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama kungah thawkiana om lo hi, a ci Sadducee-te pawlkhat pei-in thu khat a dong vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Siepa aw, Moses in, ‘Mi khat’ sanggampa in ta nei loin a zi a sisan leh, tua mipa in tua meigongnu kinunpi-in a sanggam pa adingin ta hinpieh ding hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sanggam pasal sagi om a, a tapen pa in zi nei a, ta nei loin a si hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuale a nina pa in tua nu ma kinupi-in ta nei loin si leuleu hi; a thumna pa zong tua ma bang ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />a sagina dongin tua nu a kinunpi vua, ta nei lo vive ma-in a si sieng uhi. A tawpna ah tua numei nu mama zong a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thawkia hun ciengin tua nu koi pen’ zi ahi diei? Azieh pen a sagipi-un tua nu a kinunpi kim uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Note in Lai Siengtho thu le Pasien’ vanglietna na thei lo ziehun na khielna uh tami hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Azieh pen sina panin amate a thawkia ciengin vantung mite ma bangin kipi kitenna om nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Misite thawkiana tawh kisai-in Moses’ laibu sunga theubawh tangthu sungah, Pasien in ama kungah, ‘Abraham’ Pasien, Isaac’ Pasien, le Jacob’ Pasien ka hi hi,’ a ci thu na sim ngai sih uh amah?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama pen a site’ Pasien ahi sih a, a hingte’ Pasien ahi zaw hi; note na nahkhiel mama uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thukham hil siete lahah khat in a kung va nai a, amate khatlekhat a kiselna uh a za hi. Jesu in amate hoitaha a dawn thei lam a mu ciengin ama in, “Thupieh zosiete lah panin bang amasa pen ahei?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu in, “Amasa pen in, ‘Israel aw, za in: Topa i Pasien in Topa khat beh ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa na Pasien, na lungtang zosie, na hinna zosie, le na lungsim zosie tawh na it ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A nina in, ‘Nangma na ki-it bangin na vengte na it ding hi,’ ci ahi hi. Tamte sanga a thupizaw thupieh dang om lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin thukham hil siete in ama kungah, “Siepa aw, na thugen a man hi.; nang in, ‘Ama khat beh ahi a, ama simlo koima dang om lo hi,’ ci-in a mantahin na gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuale, ‘Na lungtang zosie, na theina zosie le na thahatna zosie tawh ama na it ding,’ le, ‘Nang le nang na ki-it banga na vengte na it ding,’ ci pen meihal biehna buppi le biehpiehnate sangin thupizaw tham hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in pilvang taha a dawn thei lam Jesu in a mu ciengin ama kungah, “Pasien’ manggam tawh na kigamla sih hi,” a ci hi. Tua zaw ciengin koima in ama thu a dong ngam nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Biehinnpi sungah Jesu in thu a hil laitahin ama in, “Bang dinga thukham hil siete in Messiah pen David’ tapa a ci thei uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />David mama in, Hlagau Siengtho sawlna tawh thugen a, ‘ Topa in ka Topa tungah, “Na keng nei-ah na galte ka koi masangsie-in ka zietlamah na to in,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />David mama in ama pen Topa ci hi; tua ahile bangci bangin Jesu pen a tapa hi thei ding ahei?” a ci hi. Tuale mipite in lunglut tahin a thugen a ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua banga a hil kawmin Jesu in, “Puontuolpi sila a va kawikawi ding uh nuomsa-in vanzuanate lahah zatah hopi ding a dei thukham hil siete na kidawm un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tuale kikhopna inn sunga om tona nuom pente tunga to ding a nuom vua, pawibawlna ah zong mun thupi pente a luo nuom uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Meigongte’ inn a pumval mang vua, a kilimlawm dingin sauveipi thu a ngen uhi. Amate in mawsahna a lienzaw a nga ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Sumkholna kuong tawh kimaingatin Jesu to a, sumkholna kuong sunga sumpi khie mihonte a en hi. Mihau tampite in sum tampipi a khie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Mizawng meigong numei khat pei-in paisa khat man ahi sumsan tang ni khie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in nuazuite hlanin amate kungah, “Ke’n a tahtah a kang ci-in, sumkholna kuong sunga sumkhie zosie teng sangin tami mizawng meigongnu in a tamkhiehzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Azieh pen amate zosie in a neival a lamval uh sung panin a khie vua, tam nu in a zawn a ngau kawmkalah a kiva nading nasan hen nei loin a nei sun teng zosie a khie sieng hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Biehinnpi panin a pusuo laitahin a nuazuite khat in ama kungah, “En vawi, Siepa, tami suongtumte le tami biehinnpi golin thupi sam e izaw!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in ama dong a, “Tami biehinnpi na mu ei mah? Suong khat tungah suong khat zong a kiciengsa-in kinuasie lo ding a, a unpi-in cimzan ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Biehinnpi galkhatah a om Olive Muol tungah ama a to laitahin, Peter, James, le Andrew-te in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tua thute bang huna hing pieng ding a, tua thute zosie ang pien kuon ding ciengin bang lim ang om ding ahei? ei gen in,” ci-in a dapdawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah thugen kipan a, “Koima in ang puikhiel lo nadingin kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima’ min suongin mi tampi ang pei ding a, ‘Kei ama ka hi hi!’ ci-in mi tampi a puikhiel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gal thute le galkidona thuthangte na zah uh ciengin patau sih un; tamte pen ang pieng valon ding ma ahi a, ahi vangin hun tawpna ahi nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile minam khat le minam khat, gam khat le gam khat ang kido ding hi; mun tuomtuomte-ah zil ang kiling ding hi; kielpite ang tung ding hi. Ahi vangin tam pen gimna kipatna ahi na bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Noma na hi uleh na kikemsiem un; azieh pen amate in thukhenna zumah ang tut ding a, kikhopna inn sungah zong ang kisat ding uhi; keima ziehin gam-uhte le kumpite mai-ah teci-in na ding ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minam zosie tungah lungdamna thu kiphuongzah masa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in thusitna thuoh dingin thukhen zumah ang peipi uh ciengin bang gen ding ka hei, ci-in lunghimaw masa sih un; khum hun ciengin gen dinga ang kihil popo na gen un, azieh pen a gen ding no hi loin Hlagau Siengtho ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unau khat le khat ahi a, a pa in a ta ahi zongin thalup dingin a kileheh ding vua, tate in zong nu le pate langpangin a thatsah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima’ min ziehin mi zosie in ang muda ding uhi. Ahi vangin a tawpna donga a thuoh zote in hutdamna nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ahi vangin ama op nadinga a kilawm lo munah a susie thei kidahhuoina ang din na mu ciengun (laisimte in thei ta uheh), Judea gama omte, muolte tungah tai uheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />innkhum tunga omte kumsuh sih uh hinlen, bang khatpo la dingin zong inn sungah lut da heh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />lo lai-a om mipa zong a puon tungsil la dingin kilekia sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin numei gaite le nausen neite mi hamsie ahi uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tami hun, phalbi sung ahi lo nadingin thu ngen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien in leitung a siemcil a kipanin tuhun dong, tua banga a pieng ngai nai lo, a pieng ngai nawn lo ding gimna lienpi tua hun ciengin a pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in tua nite a tomsah sih leh koima suohta zo lo ding hi; ahi vangin ama’ teeltuomte adingin ama in tua nite a tomsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khum hun ciengin mi khatpo in, ‘En un! Tanah Messiah om! ahi sihle, ‘En un! Ama khunah om! ang ci uleh um sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zuou thei messiah-te le zuou thei kamsangte ang pieng ding a, ahi thei le a teelsate nangawn a lampielsah dingin lim le na lamdang lienpite ang bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin kigingsa-in om un; na kung vuah thu zosie kang gen sieng zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Hinanle tua hamsatna nite zaw ciengin, ni kimielsah ding a, hlapi tang nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Van panin aasite kiesuh ding a, vana om vanglietnate kiling ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Mihing Tapa, vanglietna le minthanna tawh meii lahah ang peisuh amate in a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a vantung mite sawlin lei kiu li pan le leimongte panin vanmongte dongin ama’ teelsa mite a kaikhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Theikung panin thu na sin un: Theikung a bate hing mengin a na ang dawn ciengin khuokhal hun nai ta hi, ci-in na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ma bangin note in a pieng tami thute na mu ciengun kotbieng dongin ama ang nai ta hi, ci-in thei ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, tami silte zosie ang tun sieng masangin tam khang mite a si sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Van le lei maimang ding a, ahi vangin ka thute a maimang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Ahi vangin khum ni le khum hun ding pen koima in thei lo hi. Vantung mite in hile, Tapa in hile a thei sih a, Pa khat beh in thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bang hun a ang pei ding ci thei lo na hi ziehun pilvangin kigalgingsa-in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua pen khuolzin mi khat tawh kibang hi, a zinkhiet ciengin ama in a silate khut sungah a inn ap a, a nasep ding ciet uh sepiehin, kotcingpa kungah zong limtaha a vilsiem nadingin a vaihlah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin inntehpa ang tunkia ding hun pen nitah ahiei, zankim ahiei, aah-masa khuon ahiei, phal kisem kuon ahiei, ci thei lo na hi ziehun kigingsa-in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua hi sihle ama thakhatin ang pei ciengin na kimut laitah uh ang tuohkha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Na kung vua ka gen teng ma mi zosie kunga zong ka gen ahi hi: Kiging un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Peisan Pawi le Tolsawlo Anlum Pawi a tun nading ni ni a sap ni-in siempu liente le thukham hil siete in Jesu mandapin tha thei nading lampi a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate in, “Mipite lahah buoina om thei ding ahi ziehin pawi hun sungin bawl sih vai, a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bethany khuo ah miphah Simon’ inn sunga sabuoi tungah Jesu a to laitahin, a manpha mama nard sathau namtui suongngo thawl khat tawi-in numei khat ama kungah pei a, tua nu in a thawl sukehin ama’ lu tungah tua sathau namtui a sungsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hizongle khum sunga om mi pawlkhat a thangpai vua, “Bang dinga tami sathau namtui ang buohmang mawh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tami sathau namtui kizua leh denarii zathum sanga a tamzaw kikhawng ding hi a, tua sum tawh mizawngte kihu thei ding hi,” ci-in tua nu a mawsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanle Jesu in, “Ama nu tua ci opsah lel un; bang dinga na buoisah uh ahei? Ama nu in kei adingin nasep hoi mama sem zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile mizawngte ahile note tawh a omton zing ahi a, na nop hunhunun amate tungah na migitna uh na lah thei ding uh ahi hi; ahi vangin note tawh kei kang omton zing sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama nu in ahi thei za-in a bawl zo hi; ama nu in ka luong vui nading ka pumpi sathau siengtho ei manu zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, lungdamna thu kigenna leitung muncin tengah ama nu a kiphaw zing nadingin a silbawl teng kigengen ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin sawm le nite sung panin Judas Iscariot in amate tungah Jesu a leheh thei nadingin siempu liente kungah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in tami thu a zah ciengun a lung uh dam mama a, sum pieh dingin ama a kamciem uhi. Tuaci’n ama in Jesu a leheh thei nadingin hun lemtang sui a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Peisan tuuno a kigaw ni, Tolsaw lo Anlum Pawi a ni masa ni-in a nuazuite in ama kungah, “Peisan Pawi an na neh nading hei sungah pei-in va siemkhol uleng na dei ei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a nuazuite ni sawlin ama gel kungah, “Khuopi sungah pei locin tuibeel khat a puo pasal khat tawh na kituoh ding uhi; tuapa na zui unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a lutna inntehpa kungah, ‘Siepa in, ka nuazuite tawh Peisan Pawi an ka neh thei nading ka zintunna inndan hei sung ahei, ci-in ei dongsah hi,’ va ci ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in a baisa-a na kipuosa a inndan tungnung gol khat nang lah va-un, tuanah ei teng ading va siem ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n nuazui tegel dingkhie-in khuopi sung a lut uleh, ama gel kunga a gensa vannuoi bangin a mu uhi; tuale ama gel in zong Peisan Pawi an ding a siem pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A nitah ciengin sawm le nite tawh Jesu a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale amate in a mun ciet uh la-in an a neh laitahun Jesu in, “Ke’n a tahtah a kang ci-in, note lahah ka ankuong impite khat in kei ei leheh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate a da mama vua, a banbanin, “ Topa , kei hi sam sih vang izaw?” a ci ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Sawm le nite lahah kei tawh kuong sunga anlum diepa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama’ thu a kigielsa ahi ma bangin Mihing Tapa pen a pei ding ahi a, ahi vangin Mihing Tapa leheh pa ahile gimna a thuoh ding hi! Tua mipa pieng da zaw leh ama adingin hoizaw ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An a neh laitahun ama in khomun lumkhat la-in lungdamna a ko zaw ciengin phalsuo a, amate tungah pie-in, “La un, tami in ka pumpi ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin hai khat zong la-in lungdamna a ko zaw ciengin amate pie a, amate in tua hai panin a unpi-un a dawn ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Tami in mi tampite adinga a kibuokhie thuciemna tawh kisai ka sisan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, Pasien’ manggam sungah lenggazu tha ka dawnkia ni masangsie tami lenggazu ka dawnkia ngai nawn sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in Pasien phatna la khat a sah zaw uh ciengin Olive Muol lamah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Note in na unpi-un nei taisan ding uhi; azieh pen, ‘Keima in tuucingpa ka satlia ding a, tuute a kithethang ding hi,’ ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka thawkia ciengin na masang vua Galilee gamah ka na pei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Peter in ama kungah, “Mi zosie in nang hing taisan nanle ken kang taisan sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, tuni, tuzan mama, aah nivei a khuon masangin thumvei nei niel ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in khautahin, “Nangma tawh a si ding hi nanleng kang niel sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Amate in a unpi-un tua bang ma-in a ci ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Gethsemane a kici mun khatah amate a pei vua, ama in a nuazuite kungah, “Ka thu nget kalin tanah na to un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in Peter, James le John-te zawpi a, nahpi lunggimna le buoina a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Sina ding za dongin ka lung a gim mama hi; tanah na om unlen ei na ngah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A gamla sim khat ama pei-in lei lahah bawhsuh a, ahi thei ding leh tami hun tawh ei kipelsah ta’n, ci-in thu a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in “Abba , Pa aw, nang adingin bangkim hi thei hi; keima kung panin tami hai ladawh ta’n; hizongle keima’ deina bang hi loin nangma’ deina bang hizaw taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama a pei leh amate a kimusa-a om a mu hi; ama in Peter kungah, “A kimu na mah? Nai khat sung zong ei ngah zo lo na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Gimna hun sungah note na lut lo nadingun ngahin thungen un; lungsim a lawp vangin tahsa a thanem hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Khatvei peikia-in a nget ngai teng ma a va ngenkia ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Khatvei ama a peikia leh a mit uh hah zo nawn lo ahi ziehin amate a kimusa ma-in a mu leuleu hi; amate in ama kungah gen ding a thei ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A thumveina peikia-in amate kungah, “Note khawlin a kimu hit hiet lai na hi uh amah? Pha zo ta! A hun ang tung ta hi; maw nei mite’ khut sungah Mihing Tapa a kileheh ding ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tho un, pei vai. En un, ei leheh pa ang nai ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jesu in thu a gen laitahin sawm le nite sung pan thakhatin Judas tung a, ama tawh siempu liente, thukham hil siete, le upate’ sawl, namsau le phohbul tawi mihonpi tawh a zawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tu-in a leheh pa in amate lim khat pie a, “Kang nap ding pa khu tua pa ahi hi; ama man unlen limtahin cingin peipi pai un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama a tun ciengin thakhatin Jesu kungah pei a, “Siepa!” ci-in a nam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama tungah a khut uh nga-in a man uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hizongle a gei-a dingte khat in a namsau dawhin siempu lien pa’ silapa a sat leh a bil a bantan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah, “Guta bulu khat man ding banga namsau le phohbul tawh ang kuon na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Nisielin note tawh omtonin biehinnpi sungah thu ka hil laitahin nei man sih uhi. Ahi vangin Lai Siengtho a tangtun nading hi taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Amate in a unpi-in ama a taisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Diel puonzal khat beh a sil tangval khat in Jesu a zui leh amate in ama na man vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />ahi vangin ama in zong a diel puonzal nuasie-in a guohtangin a tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Amate in siempu lien pa kungah Jesu a peipi uhi; tuale siempu liente zosie, upate, le thukham hil siete a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Peter in siempu lien pa’ leituol dongah Jesu galzui a, a cingte tawh mei-awi-in a toton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Siempu liente le vaihawm zosie-te in Jesu a tha thei nadingun teci a sui uhi; ahi vangin khat zong a mu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Azieh pen mi tampite in zuou teci a pang vua, ahi vangin a teci panna uh a kituoh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Mi pawlkhat dingin ama langah zuou teci a pang vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />“Ama in, ‘Mihingte’ khut tawh a kilam tami biehinnpi ka susie ding a, nithum sungin adang khat ka lamkia ding hi,’ a ci ka za uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tam cieng nangawnah a thugenna uh a kituoh nai vaset sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate mai-ah siempu lien pa dingin Jesu thu dong a, “Na dawng sih ding amah? Na langkhatah amau’ teci panna bang ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in dawng loin a sip dide hi. Siempu lien pa in, “ Thupha nga pa’ Tapa Messiah na hi amah?” ci-in khatvei dong leuleu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Jesu in, “Ka hi hi, ci a, tuale ‘Note in Vanglietna zietlamah a to,’ le ‘Vantung meii tung tuonga ang kumsuh Mihing Tapa,’ na mu ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu lien pa in a puon botkehin, “Bang dingin tecite kisam lai ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Note in Pasien a gensietna na za zo ta uhi! Na khensatna uh bang ahiei?” a ci hi. Amate zosie in ama pen a si dinga kilawm ahi hi, ci-in a mawsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Mi pawlkhat in cilphitin a mai tunpiehin a beng gawp vua, “Hing gen vawi!” a ci uhi. A cingte in zong peipi-in ama a beng gawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />A nei-a leituolah Peter a na op laitahin siempu lien pa’ nasem numei khat a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Mei awi-a na om Peter a mu bepin encien pai a, “Nang zong Nazareth mi Jesu tawh kipawl ngel vete aw,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama kilep a, “Na thugen theikha sing, zong telsiem vawt sing,” ci-in leituol pulamah a pusuoh hi. Tua ciengin aah a khuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Tua nasem numei nu ma in mukia a, a gei-a dingte kungah, “Tampa pen amate sunga mi khat hi ngel ve aw,” a cikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Hinanle ama kilepin a nielkia hi. Bakhat zaw ciengin a gei-a dingte in Peter kungah, “Nang zong Galilee mi khat na hi ciengin, tuate lahah khat hi valon vateh,” a cikia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama le ama kisamsie-in, “Na gen uh mipa thei kha malmal sing,” ci-in a kitomlaw kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Khum hun lientahin a niveina aah a khuong hi. Tua ciengin Peter in ama kungah, “Aah nivei a khuon masangin thumvei nei niel ding hi,” ci-in Jesu in ama kunga a gensa thute phawhkia-in ki-ip zo loin a kap hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zingmawng tungin siempu liente in upate, thukham hil siete le vaihawm teng zosie tawh kikupna khat a nei uhi. Amate in Jesu henin a peipi vua, Pilat kungah a ap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pilat in ama kungah, “Judah mite’ Kumpipa na hi amah” ci-in a dong hi. Ama in, “Na ci bang ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu liente in thu tampitah tawh ama a mawsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pilat in ama dongkia a, “Na dawn nading a om sih amah? Thu tampitah tawh ang mawmatna uh en in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in a dawnbe tuon lo ciengin Pilat in lamdang a sa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum hunlai pawi hun ciengin amate in a nget uh thongkie khatpopo Pilat in a hla thei zel ngaina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum laitahin kumpi langpan hun sunga mi that, kumpi a ledo mite tawh thong a kieton Barabbas a kici mi khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n mihonpite pei-in Pilat kungah a bawl ngai ma banga a bawl nadingin a ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in amate kungah, “Judah Kumpipa hing hla leng na nuom vuoi?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in hazatna tawh ama tungah a ap uh ahi lamtah a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin Barabbas a hlapieh zawh nadinga a gen dingin siempu liente in mihonpite a hantawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pilat in amate kungah, “Tua ahile Judah Kumpipa na ci pa uh bang law leng na nuom vuoi?” ci-in a genkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in, “Singlamte tungah khailia ta’n,” ci-in a awhsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pilat in amate kungah, “Bang dingin lah, ama in bang sietna bawl ahei?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n mihonpi a lungkimsah nop ziehin Pilat in Barabbas hla a, ama in Jesu a sat zaw ciengin singlamte tunga khailia dingin a pie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin galkapte in kumpi inntuol ah (gam-uh pa’ phuolpi a kicina) ama a peipi uhi; tuale amate in galkap honpite a kikhawmsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale amate in puontuol dupsan khat a silsah uhi; tua zaw ciengin ling tawh kumpi lukhu khat a phan vua, a lu tungah a khusah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale amate in, “Judah Kumpipa aw, na khan sawt taheh!” ci-in salam a piesol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in a lu pumpeng tawh satin a cilphit vua, khupdinin zatahna a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama a zako zaw ciengun a puontuol a hawkhietpieh vua, ama’ puonte ma a silsahkia uhi. Tua ciengin singlamte tunga khailia dingin ama a zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in a singlamte puo dingin khuota pana ang zin a kituopi khah uh mi khat a pausawl uhi; ama pen Alexander le Rufus’ pa, Cyrene khuomi Simon ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in Golgotha a kici munah (lugu mun a cinopna) Jesu a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuale amate in myrrh panamtui kha tawh kihal lenggazu a pie uhi; ahi vangin ama in a ne nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in singlamte tungah ama khailia-in a puonsilte a hawm vua, a tan ciet ding uh a thei nadingun ai a san uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Singlamte tungah ama a khai laitahun zinglam nai kuo a sat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A mawmatna uh lai-ah, “Judah Kumpipa,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama tawh misuom guta ni, khat a zietlam, khat a veilamah kikhaiton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lai Siengtho sungah, “Thukham palsatte tawh a kisimtha hi,’ a ci thu a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama a nawhkha mite in lupei-in a zako gawp vua, “Huoi lah! Biehinnpi susie-in ni thum sunga a lamkia ding pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />singlamte tung panin hing kumsuh inlen nang le nang kihunkhie ven!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ma bangin amate lahah siempu liente in zong thukham hil siete tawh ama a zako vua, “Mi dangte hunkhie thei napi ama le ama a kihun zo sih hi .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kote in mu a, ka up thei nadingun Israel Kumpipa Messiah aw, tu mama-in singlamte tung panin hing kumsah in,” a ci uhi. Singlamte tunga a kikhaipi tegel in zong ama a engho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sunkim a kipan nitah nai thum dongin gam sung mun zosie-ah mutzin a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nai thum hunin Jesu in, “Eloi, Eloi, lema sabachthani,” ci-in nahpi tahin a kiko hi, tua pen ka Pasien, ka Pasien, bang zieha nei nuasie ahei?” a cinopna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A gei-a a ding mi pawlkhat in a zah ciengun amate in, “Ngai vawi un, Elijah hlan hi ve aw,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuale mi khat tai-in lenggazu thua sungah tui hupna die-in cieng dawnah koi-in a dawn dingin pie a, “Ngah phot un, ama hunkhie dingin Elijah ang pei ei mah en vai,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu nahpi tahin kiko-in a naahu tawpin a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuale biehinnpi kidatna puonkhai a tung pana nei dongin phalni kisuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama mai-a a ding galkapmangpa in ama a naahu tawpin a si dante a mu ciengin, “Tampa, Pasien’ Tapa tahtah hi mawh ei!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A gal-et numei pawlkhat zong a om hi; tuate lahah Mary Magdalene, a nauzaw James le Joses’ nu Mary, le Salome-te a kihal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Galilee gam sungah Jesu a op lai-in tam teng in ama zui-in a kisapnate a na sih ngitnget uhi; ama tawh Jerusalem dong a zawhton numei dang tampitah zong a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua ni pen sabbath ni masang, Kigin ni ahi ziehin nitah lam ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />ulien vaihawmte lahah mi’ zatah mama, Pasien’ manggam zong lametna tawh a ngah lenlon, Arimathea khuomi Joseph, Pilat kungah hangtahin pei-in Jesu’ luong a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pilat in a si zo lam a thei ciengin lamdang a sa hi; tuale ama in galkapmangpa khat hlansahin a si zaw a sawt tai mah, ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A si zo lam galkapmangpa tung panin a thei bepin a luong Joseph a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph in diel puon khat tawi-in a luong a la dawh a, tua diel puon tawh tunin a kilemsa suong hankhuh sung khatah a siel hi. Tua ciengin ama in hankot-ah suongtum khat lia-in a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mary Magdalene le Joses’ nu Mary in a luong kisielna mun a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sabbath ni a tawp zaw ciengin Mary Magdalene, James’ nu Mary, le Salome-te in Jesu’ luong nu dingin panamtuite a lei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nipi kal khat sung ni masa pen zingmawng tung, ni suo patin hanah amate a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate khatlekhat kikumin, “Han kotvang huhna suongtumpi koi’ ei liapieh mawh ding adiei,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate a dato ciengun a gol mama tua suongtumpi a kiliasa-in a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Han sungah a lut uleh a zietlam pang vua a to puontuol kang sil tangval khat mu-in a zausi gawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate kungah, “Zau sih un; singlamte tunga a kikhailia Nazareth mi Jesu sui hi ngel uteh. Ama a thokia zo ta hi; tam munah ama om nawn lo hi. Amate in ama a sielna mun uh en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pei unlen, a nuazuite le Peter kungah Galilee lam zuonin na masang vuah pei hi, ci-in va gen ta un; ama in note ang gensa bang lienin khum munah na mu ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate zausi-in lamdang sa kawm uh ahi ziehin han pan pusuohin a tai uhi; amate a zau ziehun koima kungah a gen sih uhi. (Amate tunga thu kipiesa zosiete, Peter’ kim le pama a om mite kungah tomkimin a gen uhi. Tua zaw ciengin Jesu mama in amate tungtawnin nisuona panin nitumna dong, a siengtho le a kisie thei lo kumtawn hutdamna thu tangkona a sawlkhie hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(Nipi kal khat sung ni masapen, a thawkia zaw zingmawng tungin dawi sagi a hawlkhietpieh nu Mary Magdalene kungah ama kilaa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua nu pei-in Jesu’ kithuopi ngaite da le kapin a op laitahun tam thu a va gen ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in ama a hing ahi lam le tua nu in ama mu zo hi, ci thu a zah ciengun a um thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami teng zaw ciengin khuota lam zuonin a pei laitahun ama ni tungah a mel tuom khatin a kilaa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam tegel zong kilekia-in a gen vangun amate in a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin sabuoi tungah a to laitahun sawm le khat-te mama tungah ama a kilaa hi; ama a thawkia zaw ciengin ama a mu mite’ thu gen tahsang loin a uplana ule a lungkhauna ziehun amate a hosie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate kungah, “Leitung muncin tengah note pei unlen, a piensahsa zosiete tungah lungdamna thu phuongzah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thu um a, a ki-baptize mite in hutdamna nga ding uhi; ahi vangin a um lote in mawsah thukhenna a thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tami limte in a um mite a nuazui ding hi: Amate in keima’ min suongin dawite a notmang ding uhi; kam thate tawh a ham ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a khut utawh gulte a man ding vua, si theina gu khatpo a dawn ule zong bangma a ci sih ding uhi; cinate tungah khut a nga ding vua, amate a dam ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa Jesu in amate kungah tua banga a gen zaw ciengin vantungah ama kilato a, Pasien’ zietlamah a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale amate kuonin muncin tengah lungdamna thu a phuongzah uhi. Topa in amate tawh na semton a, a thugente uh a kipsahna-in lim lamdangte in a zuisah hi.)
  </para>
</usx>
